                        "review": "Really good fun. It's been added to the rotation along with Towerfall, Samurai Gun and Duck Game.\n\nThe music is great, the shooting is super meaty and satisfying and the sheilds are really good. Reflecting a shot into someone's face is hilarious.\n\nI think more variety in map mechanics would be good for longevity. Also maybe different shotguns? sawn-off, assault etc? Could be pick ups or vary depending on character.",
